[statement]
A regular file carrying a pax `SCHILY.devmajor` record, which no reader
gives a regular file's numbers from. Every reader reads it alike, and so
does ferrotape.

[archive]
pax SCHILY.devmajor=9
header name=f
data "x"
header name=after
data "y"
end

